			},
			"date": "2024-12-30T15:51:59.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> It’s so much fun. I’m doing a bit of Gridfinity and Multiboard and I printed some coasters for Christmas and snowflakes as reusable window decoration. </p><p>It is really magical how something that is only digital becomes a thing that you can touch in a matter of minutes or hours.</p>",
