			},
			"date": "2024-12-30T15:52:17.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Since you mentioned board games, I recommend printing custom inserts for games you like! Some of my favorite games have _terrible_ inserts, and replacing them makes set up, play, and breakdown so much easier!</p>",
