			},
			"date": "2024-12-30T15:54:12.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> A friend of mine has printed some cool stuff for me. Plant pots, for one.</p><p>You can find lots of great models here (plant pots were found here): <a href=\"https://www.printables.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"\">printables.com</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p><p>He also made a keychain of my freelance business logo, with an NFC chip in it, which I can easily reprogram using a free app on my phone. And a laptop-shaped business card holder lol</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
