			},
			"date": "2025-01-01T18:10:06.808Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://carhenge.club/@mattdsteele\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>mattdsteele</span></a></span> there are different kinds of filament with different strength properties! Maybe you’ve already seen this guide <a href=\"https://bambulab.com/en/filament/collections\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">bambulab.com/en/filament/colle</span><span class=\"invisible\">ctions</span></a></p>",
